{"audio": "1john-02.opus", "duration_ms": 237108, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 3320, "text": "1 John, Chapter Two."}, {"start_ms": 4540, "end_ms": 8520, "text": "My little children, I am writing these things to you so that you will not sin."}, {"start_ms": 9040, "end_ms": 14300, "text": "But if anyone does sin, we have an advocate before the Father—Jesus Christ, the Righteous One."}, {"start_ms": 15001, "end_ms": 21641, "text": "He Himself is the atoning sacrifice for our sins, and not only for ours but also for the sins of the whole world."}, {"start_ms": 22281, "end_ms": 26661, "text": "By this we can be sure that we have come to know Him: if we keep His commandments."}, {"start_ms": 27461, "end_ms": 33801, "text": "If anyone says, “I know Him,” but does not keep His commandments, he is a liar, and the truth is not in him."}, {"start_ms": 34521, "end_ms": 38701, "text": "But if anyone keeps His word, the love of God has been truly perfected in him."}, {"start_ms": 39361, "end_ms": 45122, "text": "By this we know that we are in Him: Whoever claims to abide in Him must walk as Jesus walked."}, {"start_ms": 46082, "end_ms": 51482, "text": "Beloved, I am not writing to you a new commandment, but an old one, which you have had from the beginning."}, {"start_ms": 52042, "end_ms": 54102, "text": "This commandment is the message you have heard."}, {"start_ms": 54842, "end_ms": 60182, "text": "Then again, I am also writing to you a new commandment, which is true in Him and also in you."}, {"start_ms": 60842, "end_ms": 64562, "text": "For the darkness is fading and the true light is already shining."}, {"start_ms": 65542, "end_ms": 70282, "text": "If anyone claims to be in the light but hates his brother, he is still in the darkness."}, {"start_ms": 70822, "end_ms": 75423, "text": "Whoever loves his brother remains in the light, and there is no cause of stumbling in him."}, {"start_ms": 76183, "end_ms": 80123, "text": "But whoever hates his brother is in the darkness and walks in the darkness."}, {"start_ms": 80523, "end_ms": 84723, "text": "He does not know where he is going, because the darkness has blinded his eyes."}, {"start_ms": 86063, "end_ms": 90223, "text": "I am writing to you, little children, because your sins have been forgiven through His name."}, {"start_ms": 90883, "end_ms": 94583, "text": "I am writing to you, fathers, because you know Him who is from the beginning."}, {"start_ms": 95243, "end_ms": 98763, "text": "I am writing to you, young men, because you have overcome the evil one."}, {"start_ms": 99423, "end_ms": 102043, "text": "I have written to you, children, because you know the Father."}, {"start_ms": 102883, "end_ms": 106464, "text": "I have written to you, fathers, because you know Him who is from the beginning."}, {"start_ms": 107024, "end_ms": 113244, "text": "I have written to you, young men, because you are strong, and the word of God abides in you, and you have overcome the evil one."}, {"start_ms": 114444, "end_ms": 116864, "text": "Do not love the world or anything in the world."}, {"start_ms": 117604, "end_ms": 121104, "text": "If anyone loves the world, the love of the Father is not in him."}, {"start_ms": 121624, "end_ms": 129604, "text": "For all that is in the world—the desires of the flesh, the desires of the eyes, and the pride of life—is not from the Father but from the world."}, {"start_ms": 130244, "end_ms": 136085, "text": "The world is passing away, along with its desires; but whoever does the will of God remains forever."}, {"start_ms": 137245, "end_ms": 145405, "text": "Children, it is the last hour; and just as you have heard that the antichrist is coming, so now many antichrists have appeared."}, {"start_ms": 146205, "end_ms": 148105, "text": "This is how we know it is the last hour."}, {"start_ms": 148745, "end_ms": 151425, "text": "They went out from us, but they did not belong to us."}, {"start_ms": 151925, "end_ms": 154785, "text": "For if they had belonged to us, they would have remained with us."}, {"start_ms": 155265, "end_ms": 158345, "text": "But their departure made it clear that none of them belonged to us."}, {"start_ms": 159485, "end_ms": 163906, "text": "You, however, have an anointing from the Holy One, and all of you know the truth."}, {"start_ms": 164746, "end_ms": 171326, "text": "I have not written to you because you lack knowledge of the truth, but because you have it, and because no lie comes from the truth."}, {"start_ms": 172226, "end_ms": 176466, "text": "Who is the liar, if it is not the one who denies that Jesus is the Christ?"}, {"start_ms": 177226, "end_ms": 180606, "text": "This is the antichrist, who denies the Father and the Son."}, {"start_ms": 181326, "end_ms": 187226, "text": "Whoever denies the Son does not have the Father, but whoever confesses the Son has the Father as well."}, {"start_ms": 188226, "end_ms": 192026, "text": "As for you, let what you have heard from the beginning remain in you."}, {"start_ms": 192506, "end_ms": 195707, "text": "If it does, you will also remain in the Son and in the Father."}, {"start_ms": 196267, "end_ms": 200347, "text": "And this is the promise that He Himself made to us: eternal life."}, {"start_ms": 201247, "end_ms": 204707, "text": "I have written these things to you about those who are trying to deceive you."}, {"start_ms": 205227, "end_ms": 212027, "text": "And as for you, the anointing you received from Him remains in you, and you do not need anyone to teach you."}, {"start_ms": 212707, "end_ms": 219707, "text": "But just as His true and genuine anointing teaches you about all things, so remain in Him as you have been taught."}, {"start_ms": 220567, "end_ms": 227968, "text": "And now, little children, remain in Christ, so that when He appears, we may be confident and unashamed before Him at His coming."}, {"start_ms": 229168, "end_ms": 235428, "text": "If you know that He is righteous, you also know that everyone who practices righteousness has been born of 